sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (Browser)
    participant Front as Frontend (React SPA)
    participant Back as Backend (Express API)
    participant Google as Google Identity & OAuth 2.0
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL

    User->>Front: Clicks "Sign in with Google"
    Front->>Back: GET /api/v1/auth/google/url
    Back->>Google: Generates OAuth URL with scopes (email, profile, gmail.readonly, calendar.readonly)
    Back-->>Front: Returns authUrl
    Front-->>User: Redirects browser to Google Consent Screen
    
    User->>Google: Authenticates & grants requested scopes
    Google-->>Front: Redirects to /auth/callback?code=AUTH_CODE
    
    Front->>Back: POST /api/v1/auth/google/callback { code: AUTH_CODE }
    Back->>Google: Exchanges AUTH_CODE for Access Token & Refresh Token
    Google-->>Back: Returns { access_token, refresh_token, expiry_date, id_token }
    
    Back->>Google: Fetches user profile (email, name, picture)
    Back->>DB: Upserts user record into 'users' table
    Back->>DB: Encrypts & stores tokens into 'connected_accounts' table
    Back->>Back: Generates LifeSynch JWT session token
    Back-->>Front: Returns { token: JWT, user: { id, email, name, hasGmail, hasCalendar } }
    
    Front->>Front: Stores JWT in localStorage
    Front-->>User: Navigates to Dashboard & initiates initial sync

